{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/blog/layout,_N_T_/blog/[slug]/layout,_N_T_/blog/[slug]/page,_N_T_/blog/cute-pet-names-every-personality"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/blog/$d$slug/__PAGE__","/blog/$d$slug","/blog","/_index","/_head"]},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/0_novvjei_gxi.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/0wa60lc2wlwoc.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/15orcrkp-_9ct.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2ncdmtj91g36a.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/166-a3utgd-lq.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-10b5wutro9flo.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3i2zmhpv5m7u2.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\" async=\"\"></script><script async=\"\" src=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-6710458178434465\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-C9HPD23Y02\" as=\"script\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.json\"/><title>150 Cute Pet Names for Every Personality Type 💕</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Find the cutest pet names matched to your animal&#x27;s unique personality. From sweet and gentle names to bubbly and energetic ones, discover 150 adorable options organized by temperament and style.\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.json\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"cute pet names, adorable pet names, sweet pet names, cute dog names, cute cat names, kawaii names\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><meta name=\"p:domain_verify\" content=\"acc18c9aa2855ead49c874b6cac9cb61\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://bestanimalnames.com/blog/cute-pet-names-every-personality/\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"150 Cute Pet Names for Every Personality Type 💕\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Find the cutest pet names matched to your animal&#x27;s unique personality. From sweet and gentle names to bubbly and energetic ones, discover 150 adorable options organized by temperament and style.\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"150 Cute Pet Names for Every Personality Type 💕\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Find the cutest pet names matched to your animal&#x27;s unique personality. From sweet and gentle names to bubbly and energetic ones, discover 150 adorable options organized by temperament and style.\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"name\":\"BestAnimalNames\",\"url\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com\",\"description\":\"Free animal name generator with 989+ animals. Browse thousands of name ideas across 9 categories.\",\"potentialAction\":{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/animals?q={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":\"required name=search_term_string\"}}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-[#f8fafc] text-[#1e293b]\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class=\"bg-white border-b border-gray-200 sticky top-0 z-50\"><nav class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 h-16 flex items-center justify-between\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a class=\"text-xl font-bold text-primary hover:text-primary-dark transition-colors\" href=\"/\">🐾 AnimalNameGen</a><div class=\"flex gap-6 text-sm font-medium text-gray-600\"><a class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"/animals/\">Animals</a><a class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"/guide/japanese-animal-names/\">Guides</a><a class=\"hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"/blog/\">Blog</a></div></nav></header><main class=\"flex-1\" aria-label=\"Main content\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BlogPosting\",\"headline\":\"150 Cute Pet Names for Every Personality Type 💕\",\"description\":\"Find the cutest pet names matched to your animal's unique personality. From sweet and gentle names to bubbly and energetic ones, discover 150 adorable options organized by temperament and style.\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-06-05\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-07-06\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"BestAnimalNames Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/about/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"BestAnimalNames\",\"url\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/blog/cute-pet-names-every-personality/\"},\"wordCount\":674,\"articleBody\":\"📋 Table of Contents  💕 The Science of Cute Names There is a genuine scientific reason we are drawn to cute pet names. Research in psychology and neuroscience shows that hearing or saying cute words triggers the release of dopamine — the brain's reward chemical. When you name your pet something adorable, every single time you say that name, your brain gets a tiny burst of pleasure. This is not trivial or silly — it is a measurable neurochemical response that strengthens your bond with your pet and makes daily interactions more joyful and rewarding for both of you. Cute names also serve a social function. They signal warmth, approachability, and good humor to everyone who meets your pet. A dog named Cupcake or a cat named Muffin is immediately perceived as friendly, lovable, and safe — which can be genuinely helpful in social situations, at the veterinarian, and when introducing your pet to new people. The name sets expectations, and cute names set the warmest, most welcoming expectations possible. The best cute names strike a balance between sweetness and substance. A name that is too aggressively saccharine can become tiresome over years of daily use. A name that is gently sweet while still feeling like a real, respectable name — that is the sweet spot. This guide will help you find that perfect balance for your pet's unique personality, drawing from multiple categories of cuteness to find the name that fits just right. 🍯 Sweet & Gentle Names Sweet and gentle names suit pets with calm, loving dispositions — the ones who approach life with quiet dignity and warm affection rather than boisterous energy. These names evoke honey, sugar, and all things softly delightful. They work beautifully for pets who are naturally gentle, who move through the world with grace, and whose primary interaction style is loving rather than playful. Honey stands as the archetype of this category — golden, natural, and universally beloved. Sugar, Sweetie, and Dulce (Spanish for sweet) follow the same warm tradition. Maple carries autumnal coziness and natural sweetness. Caramel suggests rich, complex warmth. Cinnamon adds a touch of spice to the sweetness. These names feel like a warm hug every time you say them, which is exactly the feeling they are meant to evoke. Flower names form a natural subset of sweet names: Daisy, Lily, Poppy, Rose, Violet, and Iris all carry associations with natural beauty, gentleness, and the quiet pleasure of a blooming garden. These names work across species and breeds, bringing a touch of botanical poetry to your daily life with your pet. 🎀 Tiny & Precious Names There is something irresistible about giving a tiny, precious name to a tiny, precious pet. These names celebrate smallness as a virtue rather than something to overcome. They are perfect for toy breeds, kittens, and any pet whose diminutive size is one of their most endearing qualities. Peanut is perhaps the most beloved tiny name of all time — small, cherished, and universally adored. Bean, Pebble, Pip, Dot, and Mini all follow this tradition of celebrating tininess with warmth. Mochi — the soft, sweet Japanese rice cake — has become wildly popular for small pets, capturing their squishy, lovable nature perfectly. Nugget suggests a tiny treasure of immense value, while Button invokes something so cute you want to press it. The key to tiny names is ensuring they come from a place of genuine affection rather than diminishment. Your tiny pet may be small in stature, but they are enormous in personality and importance. The name should celebrate their compact perfection rather than make them seem less significant. Names like Jewel, Gem, Pearl, and Treasure all communicate that small things can be the most precious of all. 🔗 Explore More Cute Names Explore our name generators for {algae-octopus}, {arabian-wolf}, {argonaut}, {amazon-parrot}, and {african-slender-snouted-crocodile} to find the perfect name for your companion. Our complete collection features 20-plus cute names for every animal species. Explore dog cute names, cat cute names, and discover our naming guides for comprehensive naming advice.\",\"image\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/images/og/blog-cute-pet-names-every-personality.png\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\"}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can a cute name work for a large dog?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Absolutely, and the contrast can be genuinely delightful. A 150-pound Mastiff named Muffin or Cupcake is memorable, approachable, and instantly communicates that this giant dog is a gentle soul. Ironic cute names for large pets are an entire beloved tradition in pet naming and often become conversation starters that help people feel more comfortable around large breeds.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do cute names work for male pets?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, and the trend is growing. Names like Peanut, Bean, and Mochi are genuinely gender-neutral and used widely for both male and female pets. The idea that male pets need tough, masculine names is fading as pet owners increasingly prioritize names that simply feel right for their individual animal's personality regardless of traditional gender associations.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Will I get tired of saying an extremely cute name every day?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"This is a legitimate consideration. The sweet spot is finding a name that is undeniably cute without being so saccharine that it becomes grating over years of daily use. Test the name by saying it out loud twenty times in a row. If you still enjoy it after that repetition test, it has genuine staying power.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What makes a name genuinely cute versus trying too hard?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Authentic cuteness comes from names that feel natural, warm, and true to your pet. Trying-too-hard cute names often rely on forced baby talk, excessive syllables, or trendy gimmicks. A simple, sincere cute name like Bean or Honey will age far better than something engineered to maximize cuteness at the expense of authenticity.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Blog\",\"item\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/blog/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"150 Cute Pet Names for Every Personality Type 💕\",\"item\":\"https://bestanimalnames.com/blog/cute-pet-names-every-personality/\"}]}</script><nav class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-3 text-sm text-gray-500 flex gap-1 flex-wrap\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a class=\"hover:text-primary\" href=\"/\">Home</a><span>/</span><a class=\"hover:text-primary\" href=\"/blog/\">Blog</a><span>/</span><span class=\"text-gray-800 font-medium\">150 Cute Pet Names for Every Personality Type 💕</span></nav><article class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10\"><div class=\"text-center mb-10\"><div class=\"text-6xl mb-4\">💕</div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-xs text-gray-500 mb-3\"><span class=\"bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Cute Names</span><span>2026-06-05</span><span class=\"text-gray-500\">By BestAnimalNames Editorial Team</span></div><h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4\">150 Cute Pet Names for Every Personality Type 💕</h1><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Find the cutest pet names matched to your animal&#x27;s unique personality. From sweet and gentle names to bubbly and energetic ones, discover 150 adorable options organized by temperament and style.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">cute pet names</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">adorable pet names</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">sweet pet names</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">cute dog names</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">cute cat names</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">kawaii names</span></div></div><div class=\"prose prose-lg max-w-none\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\">📋 Table of Contents</h2><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/5 to-indigo-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-primary/10 mb-8\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4\">📋 Table of Contents</h3><ol class=\"space-y-2 list-none pl-0\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\">1<!-- -->.</span><a href=\"#intro\" class=\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\">The Science of Cute Names</a></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\">2<!-- -->.</span><a href=\"#sweet\" class=\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\">Sweet &amp; Gentle Names</a></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\">3<!-- -->.</span><a href=\"#bubbly\" class=\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\">Bubbly &amp; Energetic Names</a></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\">4<!-- -->.</span><a href=\"#tiny\" class=\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\">Tiny &amp; Precious Names</a></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\">5<!-- -->.</span><a href=\"#cozy\" class=\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\">Cozy &amp; Comforting Names</a></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\">6<!-- -->.</span><a href=\"#kawaii\" class=\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\">Kawaii Japanese Cute Names</a></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\">7<!-- -->.</span><a href=\"#faq\" class=\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\">FAQ</a></li></ol></div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\">💕 The Science of Cute Names</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">There is a genuine scientific reason we are drawn to cute pet names. Research in psychology and neuroscience shows that hearing or saying cute words triggers the release of dopamine — the brain&#x27;s reward chemical. When you name your pet something adorable, every single time you say that name, your brain gets a tiny burst of pleasure. This is not trivial or silly — it is a measurable neurochemical response that strengthens your bond with your pet and makes daily interactions more joyful and rewarding for both of you.</p><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">Cute names also serve a social function. They signal warmth, approachability, and good humor to everyone who meets your pet. A dog named Cupcake or a cat named Muffin is immediately perceived as friendly, lovable, and safe — which can be genuinely helpful in social situations, at the veterinarian, and when introducing your pet to new people. The name sets expectations, and cute names set the warmest, most welcoming expectations possible.</p><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">The best cute names strike a balance between sweetness and substance. A name that is too aggressively saccharine can become tiresome over years of daily use. A name that is gently sweet while still feeling like a real, respectable name — that is the sweet spot. This guide will help you find that perfect balance for your pet&#x27;s unique personality, drawing from multiple categories of cuteness to find the name that fits just right.</p><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\">🍯 Sweet &amp; Gentle Names</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">Sweet and gentle names suit pets with calm, loving dispositions — the ones who approach life with quiet dignity and warm affection rather than boisterous energy. These names evoke honey, sugar, and all things softly delightful. They work beautifully for pets who are naturally gentle, who move through the world with grace, and whose primary interaction style is loving rather than playful.</p><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">Honey stands as the archetype of this category — golden, natural, and universally beloved. Sugar, Sweetie, and Dulce (Spanish for sweet) follow the same warm tradition. Maple carries autumnal coziness and natural sweetness. Caramel suggests rich, complex warmth. Cinnamon adds a touch of spice to the sweetness. These names feel like a warm hug every time you say them, which is exactly the feeling they are meant to evoke.</p><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">Flower names form a natural subset of sweet names: Daisy, Lily, Poppy, Rose, Violet, and Iris all carry associations with natural beauty, gentleness, and the quiet pleasure of a blooming garden. These names work across species and breeds, bringing a touch of botanical poetry to your daily life with your pet.</p><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\">🎀 Tiny &amp; Precious Names</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">There is something irresistible about giving a tiny, precious name to a tiny, precious pet. These names celebrate smallness as a virtue rather than something to overcome. They are perfect for toy breeds, kittens, and any pet whose diminutive size is one of their most endearing qualities.</p><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">Peanut is perhaps the most beloved tiny name of all time — small, cherished, and universally adored. Bean, Pebble, Pip, Dot, and Mini all follow this tradition of celebrating tininess with warmth. Mochi — the soft, sweet Japanese rice cake — has become wildly popular for small pets, capturing their squishy, lovable nature perfectly. Nugget suggests a tiny treasure of immense value, while Button invokes something so cute you want to press it.</p><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">The key to tiny names is ensuring they come from a place of genuine affection rather than diminishment. Your tiny pet may be small in stature, but they are enormous in personality and importance. The name should celebrate their compact perfection rather than make them seem less significant. Names like Jewel, Gem, Pearl, and Treasure all communicate that small things can be the most precious of all.</p><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\">🔗 Explore More Cute Names</h2><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">Explore our name generators for <a class=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\" href=\"/animal/algae-octopus/\">Algae Octopus<!-- --> Name Generator</a>, <a class=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\" href=\"/animal/arabian-wolf/\">Arabian Wolf<!-- --> Name Generator</a>, <a class=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\" href=\"/animal/argonaut/\">Argonaut<!-- --> Name Generator</a>, <a class=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\" href=\"/animal/amazon-parrot/\">Amazon Parrot<!-- --> Name Generator</a>, and <a class=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\" href=\"/animal/african-slender-snouted-crocodile/\">African Slender-Snouted Crocodile<!-- --> Name Generator</a> to find the perfect name for your companion.</p><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">Our complete collection features 20-plus cute names for every animal species. Explore dog cute names, cat cute names, and discover our naming guides for comprehensive naming advice.</p></div><section class=\"mt-12 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\">❓ Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class=\"space-y-3\"><details class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\"><summary class=\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\">Can a cute name work for a large dog?</summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Absolutely, and the contrast can be genuinely delightful. A 150-pound Mastiff named Muffin or Cupcake is memorable, approachable, and instantly communicates that this giant dog is a gentle soul. Ironic cute names for large pets are an entire beloved tradition in pet naming and often become conversation starters that help people feel more comfortable around large breeds.</p></details><details class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\"><summary class=\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\">Do cute names work for male pets?</summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Yes, and the trend is growing. Names like Peanut, Bean, and Mochi are genuinely gender-neutral and used widely for both male and female pets. The idea that male pets need tough, masculine names is fading as pet owners increasingly prioritize names that simply feel right for their individual animal&#x27;s personality regardless of traditional gender associations.</p></details><details class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\"><summary class=\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\">Will I get tired of saying an extremely cute name every day?</summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">This is a legitimate consideration. The sweet spot is finding a name that is undeniably cute without being so saccharine that it becomes grating over years of daily use. Test the name by saying it out loud twenty times in a row. If you still enjoy it after that repetition test, it has genuine staying power.</p></details><details class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\"><summary class=\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\">What makes a name genuinely cute versus trying too hard?</summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">Authentic cuteness comes from names that feel natural, warm, and true to your pet. Trying-too-hard cute names often rely on forced baby talk, excessive syllables, or trendy gimmicks. A simple, sincere cute name like Bean or Honey will age far better than something engineered to maximize cuteness at the expense of authenticity.</p></details></div></section><section class=\"mt-12\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\">🐾 Related Animal Name Generators</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3\"><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/animal/vulturine-guineafowl/\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-1\">🐦</div><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Vulturine Guineafowl</div></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/animal/rosy-boa/\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-1\">🐍</div><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Rosy Boa</div></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/animal/tonkinese/\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-1\">🐱</div><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Tonkinese Cat</div></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/animal/cuckoo/\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-1\">🐦</div><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Cuckoo</div></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/animal/painted-turtle/\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-1\">🐢</div><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\">Painted Turtle</div></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/animal/praying-mantis/\"><div class=\"text-2xl mb-1\">🦗</div><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray